"Azure Rabbit is a Rabbit class trait: a magic coat that aids the Rabbit's running."
"It turns a share of gravity's pull into force when the Rabbit kicks off ground."
"It grows stronger as speed rises, but stamina still limits the Rabbit."
"It works only while the Rabbit carries an item, and drops out if the item is dropped."
"It is toggled on and off like a switch in the head or through the interface."
"It can be activated without the System, through effort and focus on movement."
"Self-activation feels like existing harder, with more personal space."
"It works off ground only; walls of material not native to the planet give no push."
"Its original description: 'You are lighter on your feet when your skills are in use.'"
"It uses its own fixed definition of ground, and it leaves shallow holes where it kicks."
"It makes thin crust and loose sand feel solid while moving."
"A lapse of attention can crack it; it is mended by asserting its existence deliberately."
